{"title": "Ringless Gem", "pageid": 14371, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ringless_Gem", "categories": ["Bugs", "Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GEM_Peridot_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/GEM_Peridot_Faded.png/300px-GEM_Peridot_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/GEM_Peridot_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ringless Gem image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/GEM_Peridot_Faded.png/300px-GEM_Peridot_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/GEM_Peridot_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Ringless Gem</b> is a common yet one-of-a-kind <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Item</a> that can be combined with the <a href=\"/wiki/Gemless_Ring\" title=\"Gemless Ring\">Gemless Ring</a>. Primarily of use for bartering or sale to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A gem that was cut to sit neatly in a ring.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-22b57764158113f2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9278c1d2e22dd89aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">QUEST_WYR_RinglessGemstone</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_WYR_RinglessGemstone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_WYR_RinglessGemstone\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">219a9d40-41b3-4225-a187-64bbc8e96525</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:219a9d40-41b3-4225-a187-64bbc8e96525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:219a9d40-41b3-4225-a187-64bbc8e96525\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/38px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/50px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ferg Drogher\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\">Ferg Drogher</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> refugee camp at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;45&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-98</span>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This gem can be combined with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gemless_Ring\" title=\"Gemless Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Gemless_Ring_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gemless_Ring\" title=\"Gemless Ring\">Gemless Ring</a> looted from the Refugee Corpse on the cliffs of northeastern <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;46&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;66</span>.</li>\n<li>Combining the Ringless Gem and the Gemless Ring creates a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Ring\" title=\"Tarnished Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Ring\" title=\"Tarnished Ring\">Tarnished Ring</a>. This item seems to have no purpose other than to be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a> for a bit of extra gold.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The game code shows that the crafted ring should be named \"Magic Ring\" with the description \"Considered sacred by some gnomes and halflings, the gem set in this ring sparkles brilliantly.\" due to its <code>Item Template</code>.  However, when the game spawns items created via <code>Item Combination</code> it ignores <code>Item Template</code> and instead defaults to <code>Parent Template</code>, which in this case is <code>LOOT_GEN_Ring_A_Simple_Gold</code> and thus why the crafted ring appears with the name and description that it has.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223057\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2196/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30611/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8992/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\n